---
// Chapter 01: Arrival Story (Mobile-First Editorial)
---

<section class="section arrival-section" id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="arrival-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Story Copy -->
      <div class="arrival-copy reveal-left">
        <div class="story-marker">Chapter 01 · Arrival</div>
        <div class="eyebrow">The city comes first</div>
        <h2>Varanasi can be intense. Your stay shouldn’t be.</h2>
        
        <div class="mobile-poetic-block">
          <p class="story-p-short">
            You spend the day inside the living energy of Kashi.
          </p>
          <div class="kashi-elements-row">
            <span>Temples</span> · <span>Ghats</span> · <span>Bells</span> · <span>Ganga</span> · <span>Old Lanes</span>
          </div>
          <p class="story-p-short">
            Then you come back somewhere straightforward, welcoming, and quiet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="lead desktop-lead">
          A visitor absorbs crowds, rituals and sounds all day long. Thakur Ji becomes where that energy softens — a clean, dependable reset between moments in the holy city.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="story-quote">
          “See Kashi fully. Then come back somewhere that lets you slow down.”
        </blockquote>

        <div class="arrival-chips">
          <span class="chip">Arrive without fuss</span>
          <span class="chip">Cool down & reset</span>
          <span class="chip">Rest with family</span>
          <span class="chip">Step back into Kashi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Reception Photo with inner gold border & floating seal -->
      <div class="arrival-photo-wrap reveal">
        <div class="photo-frame">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/images/reception.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img 
              id="storyParallax" 
              src="/images/reception.jpg" 
              alt="Reception and welcoming entry of Thakur Ji Guest House Varanasi" 
              loading="lazy" 
              width="1418" 
              height="944"
            />
          </picture>
          <div class="photo-gradient"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>
            YOUR PAUSE<br />
            BETWEEN MOMENTS<br />
            IN KASHI
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.arrival-section {
  padding-top: 90px;
  padding-bottom: 90px;
}

.arrival-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
  gap: 6vw;
  align-items: center;
}

.arrival-copy h2 {
  margin: 10px 0 18px;
  font: 600 clamp(38px, 4.8vw, 76px) / 0.94 var(--font-serif);
  letter-spacing: -1px;
  color: #5d1118;
}

.mobile-poetic-block {
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.story-p-short {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #3e261f;
  margin: 6px 0;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.kashi-elements-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #a47d44;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 10px 0;
}

.lead {
  font-size: 14.5px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--soft);
}

.story-quote {
  margin: 24px 0 22px;
  padding-left: 20px;
  border-left: 2px solid #bf914b;
  font: 500 clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px) / 1.3 var(--font-serif);
  color: #5d1118;
  font-style: italic;
}

.arrival-chips {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.chip {
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(115, 77, 51, 0.14);
  background: #fffaf2;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #704936;
}

/* Right Photo Frame */
.arrival-photo-wrap {
  position: relative;
}

.photo-frame {
  height: 560px;
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 30px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(47, 23, 16, 0.18);
  background: #25090c;
}

.photo-frame img {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -5% 0 0 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 110%;
  object-fit: cover;
  will-change: transform;
}

.photo-frame::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(241, 210, 145, 0.35);
  border-radius: 20px;
  z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.photo-gradient {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 65%, rgba(20, 5, 6, 0.45) 100%);
  z-index: 1;
}

.story-seal {
  position: absolute;
  left: -40px;
  bottom: 40px;
  width: 130px;
  height: 130px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #f7ede0;
  color: #6a1118;
  border: 1px solid rgba(185, 137, 63, 0.35);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  font: 700 11.5px / 1.3 var(--font-serif);
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  transform: rotate(-8deg);
  z-index: 4;
  padding: 14px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .arrival-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .photo-frame {
    height: 440px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .arrival-section {
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .arrival-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 9vw, 44px);
    line-height: 0.95;
  }
  .photo-frame {
    height: 360px;
    border-radius: 22px;
  }
  .story-seal {
    left: 12px;
    bottom: 12px;
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
  }
}
</style>
